OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry across
OL,6,Fthe south and southeast, though often
OL,7,Fcloudy elsewhere. Rain spreads
OL,8,Fsoutheast across Northern Ireland,
OL,9,FScotland and into northwest England,
OL,10,Fbecoming heavier by dawn. Showers may
OL,11,Fdevelop ahead of this across parts of
OL,12,FWales and northern England.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FHeavy rain moves across
OL,15,FScotland, Wales and England on
OL,16,FWednesday with some heavy bursts at
OL,17,Ftimes and perhaps some hail in the
OL,18,Feast. Warm in the southeast, fresher
OL,19,Felsewhere.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
